-6gZnqPt_GcerAdyOGnRPiqPie5nOdz9aQ8KsY8T-Jgcq9dc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlg83OeV17wXTcRYwxZhZzGqUZmB0UoHljNycZaVy93g&oe=6AF9E806"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot06.png", "id": "814313424499393", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_814313434499392_7247628378715125067_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4YhnL567Jl0Q7kNvwFRuHg3&_nc_oc=AdoqzYFi_1prd-Bp8eF9CLaom3-PnRQkgO6WKSFbvBbRm3jD3M-o5k1OrhE7Zowik9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvPTK3Ch7vRDk19cB2gGaC26Zc_CpIokdLjzt7Jy0vKA&oe=6AF9C9FC"}, "display_name": "Shoot Fireball", "keywords": [], "long_description": "[Game Overview]\nStep into mixed reality and unleash powerful magic from your hands.\nShoot fireballs from your right hand and ice blasts from your left, directly into your real-world environment.\n\nEnjoy dynamic visual effects and satisfying impacts when your magic hits walls around you.\n\n[Features]\n- Hand tracking magic system (no controllers needed)\n- Fire and ice spells with immersive effects\n- Real-world interaction using MR\n- Responsive sound and impact effects\n\n[Controls]\n- Hand gestures only\n- Simple and intuitive actions:\n  - Palm up: generate magic energy\n  - Fist: charge power\n  - Open hand forward: release your spell\n\n[Recommended for]\n- MR / VR beginners\n- Anyone who wants to feel like a wizard in real life\n\n[Note]\n- This is a magic experience focused on visual effects and immersion.\n- No enemies or combat gameplay.", "short_description": "Shoot fire and ice ball in MR space!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yyoshifactory-dotcom.github.io/plivacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yoshimoto Factory", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yyoshifactory-dotcom.github.io/plivacypolicy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COM